Hi!

I play nethack since 3.0.7 now and just a few days go I discovered a
feature I never thought of ...

I zapped my way to medusas island with a wand of cold, making ice
pathways, when some monster (can't remember) attacked me. I killed it
and went on. Killed medusa, went some levels down, then came back to
make some potions of water.

When I came back I saw a corpse lying on my ice path. Having hunger at
that time (and a blessed unicorn horn, just in case) I ate it. And it
was still fresh!

Icy ground seems to hold corpses fresh, just like ice boxes. Now, that
opens up a whole new field for abuse. Imagine: Find a level with a
fountain, make it overflow, zap it with a wand of cold and then store
all those floating eyes, tengus, quantum mechs, etc. you just killed.
Even better if there's an altar on the level.

You just have to look out for those monsters with wands of fire ...

Nethack is just great: After 4 years of playing there are still new
features ...

